OL,3,AEarl Spencer should pull Diana book
OL,4,Afrom shelves, Piers Morgan says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPiers Morgan has called for Earl
OL,7,FSpencer's book about Princess Diana to
OL,8,Fbe pulled from the shelves over a
OL,9,Ffactual error.
OL,11,FEarl Spencer, Princess Diana's brother,
OL,12,Fapologised to Morgan for incorrectly
OL,13,Fdescribing him in the memoir as the
OL,14,Feditor of the Daily Mirror when the
OL,15,FMirror Group published "highly
OL,16,Fintrusive photographs of Princess Diana
OL,17,Fat the gym" in 1993.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
