OL,3,AEarl Spencer should pull Diana book
OL,4,Afrom shelves, Piers Morgan says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Morgan said he
OL,7,Faccepted the apology but that his
OL,8,Flawyers would be "laying out that we
OL,9,Fwant the offending pages to be removed
OL,10,Ffrom this book. And if that means they
OL,11,Fpulp the first edition, so be it".
OL,13,FThe BBC understands Penguin, the
OL,14,Fpublishers of Swan Song: Diana, My
OL,15,FSister, will be amending this one point
OL,16,Fin future editions of the book.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
